class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597660/extras/21df70028cd633f77c61b4ab6a5f0b50.avif?t=1750348485\" width=800 height=246 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the snake: Follow Tutorial Snake and his friends and improve your scores to unlock new minigames as long as you\u2019re playing!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597660/extras/bc4601e7875a8991dc539ef4569fca08.poster.avif?t=1750348485\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597660/extras/bc4601e7875a8991dc539ef4569fca08.webm?t=1750348485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597660/extras/bc4601e7875a8991dc539ef4569fca08.mp4?t=1750348485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
